  characterID: veya
  displayName: Veya
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 01171cc37ac9ec1438d227dc2723c30c, type: 3}
  shortDescription: A quiet scout who notices hidden threats first and speaks only
    when she has something worth hearing.
  personalityTraits:
  - observant
  - dry
  - elusive
  - cautious
  speechStyle: Sparse, cool, and slightly poetic. She favors sharp images over long
    explanations.
  exampleLines:
  - The room is smiling too hard. Something is wrong.
  - Silence is useful when everyone else is advertising their fear.
  - I trust exits more than promises.
